# Biome check and format

At the **end of every plan** (as the final plan step) and after finishing implementation work that touches frontend files, always run Biome check and format from `frontend/`:

```bash
cd frontend && npx biome check --write .
```

- Prefer `biome check --write .` so lint/fix issues are fixed in one pass.
- If you only need to verify without writing: `npx biome check .` (same as `npm run lint`).
- Fix any remaining reported errors before considering the work done.
- Do not skip this step even for small frontend changes.
